			title: "Put Up the Trellis and Plant 4 Grape Starts"
			subtitle: "8 lattice panels, 4 grape starts, two waterings."
			icon: "vinery:red_grape_seeds"
			description: ["Halden: \"South slope, morning sun, out of the wind. Josie argued with me about this spot for nine years.\"", "", "Place the 8 lattice panels on the marked terrace behind the hedge, plant the 4 grape starts along the base, and water them twice with the watering can. Hand in one Red Grape when they fruit.", "", "The press and the barrel come with them, and the Harvest Supper drinks what this trellis makes."]
