		{
			id: "044F10540A7996F8"
			title: "Use Tobin's Pick on All 6 Marked Spots"
			subtitle: "He marked them twice, in two colours."
			icon: "geolosys:prospectors_pick"
			description: ["Tobin: \"Hit the sample, read the sample. If it says copper it means copper is under you, not near you — under you.\"", "", "Take the prospector's pick to the 6 spots on Tobin's survey maps and right-click each one. The sixth reading is the copper cluster.", "", "Copper and tin get pinned to your maps, and Josie's tool chest gives up the Adit Pick and sixteen sticks of powder. The frame wants tin."]
