			title: "Put a Bearing and 8 Sails on the Mill Roof"
			subtitle: "The 16 wool is in Bram's crate by the door."
			icon: "create:windmill_bearing"
			description: ["Bram: \"Stream drops every August, and the wheel stops with it. Wind doesn't drop — put it on the roof.\"", "", "Craft one Windmill Bearing and 8 White Sails and hold them to hand in, then set the bearing in the marked roof slot and the eight sails on its shaft. The 16 wool is in Bram's crate by the mill door.", "", "A second Encased Fan comes with the gear kit — one stays belted to the mill, one goes down to the sand."]
