			title: "Wash Lake Sand Into 64 Washed Silica"
			subtitle: "128 sand makes exactly 64."
			icon: "valley:washed_silica"
			description: ["Bram: \"Fan over running water, sand on the belt underneath. Wash it twice if it still looks like a beach.\"", "", "Take Nella's 128 Lake Sand to any crafting bench. Eight sand plus a bucket of water makes four Washed Silica — sixteen times gives you the 64 this quest wants. The 128 on the pier is exactly enough: nothing left over, nothing short.", "", "If you would rather build than craft: an Encased Fan blowing down through running water washes it one-for-one, with no buckets at all.", "", "Washed Silica is what a Thermal Machine Frame is made of now — press U on the frame in JEI and the silica sits where the tin used to."]
