			description: ["Bram: \"Her drawing, her handwriting, and I couldn't make it work in thirty years. You have the sand, so try.\"", "", "Take Bram's crate of Josie's papers and craft one Thermal Machine Frame — Washed Silica plus tin from the deposit Tobin pinned on your map. Hold it to hand it in.", "", "Every Thermal machine is that frame with a coil under it. Bram wound these eight himself; the Stirling Dynamo is the first real power."]
