			subtitle: "Four marked spots, mill to square."
			icon: "minecraft:lantern"
			description: ["Oda: \"Six lamps lit, thirty-four dark. I count them every night whether I mean to or not.\"", "", "Put a lamp post on each of the 4 marked spots, mill to square, then run Energy Duct from the Stirling Dynamo's output face to the nearest two. Posts and duct are in the crate at the mill door. The Redstone Furnace eats power — leave it out.", "", "Lamps 10 of 40. Nothing hostile spawns anywhere along the lit road, for good."]
