		{
			id: "1ED9ED8AB90E92EB"
			title: "Fit Out Wisp's Stilt House Over the Shallows"
			subtitle: "Every spot on the decking is marked."
			icon: "ribbits:swamp_lantern"
			description: ["Wisp: \"Two places is too many places for one person. I would like to be in the one place, with you lot. Please can I?\"", "", "The platform is out over the shallows, every spot marked. From the crate on the decking: a mossy oak post on each of the 6 marks, the bed on the wool mat, the door in the doorway, a window in each hole, the 3 swamp lanterns on the hooks.", "", "Wisp moves into town, marsh trade opens, and Oda's stockroom sends over all 48 sheets of paper and the torches for the lanterns."]
