			subtitle: "Eight paper around one torch, six times."
			icon: "valley:paper_lantern"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Nella says nobody will come, and Nella has made forty of these. Draw your own conclusions, love.\"", "", "Eight paper around one torch makes four Paper Lanterns — six batches for twenty-four, so 48 paper and 6 torches. Oda's stockroom already put all 48 sheets and 24 torches in your bag. Any crafting table will do.", "", "These are the lanterns that go on the water at the Float. The festival clothes and 20 Valley Scrip come with them."]
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.8d
			dependencies: ["1ED9ED8AB90E92EB"]
