			subtitle: "Act II finale — the Lantern Float."
			icon: "bountiful:bountyboard"
			description: ["Oda: \"Three notices on the board and all three get filled the same week. That has not happened since Josie.\"", "", "Take 24 wheat off your fields, 8 cooked cod off Nella's lake and 8 white wool off Cloud and Also Cloud, and hand all three notices in at the board outside the store.", "", "Forty lamps. Fifteen people. One winter that nobody leaves.", "", "Then everybody walks down to the water and sets the lanterns on it, and Nella stands at the end of the pier counting the people who came."]
